{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43525","headline":"七言重联句 · 颜真卿","name":"七言重联句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"顷持宪简推高步，独占诗流横素波。\n不是中情深惠好，谁能千里远经过。\n诗书宛似陪康乐，少长还同宴永和。\n夜酌此时看碾玉，晨趋几日重鸣珂。\n万井更深空寂寞，千方雾起隐嵯峨。\n荧荧远火分渔浦，历历寒枝露鸟窠。\n汉朝旧学君公隐，鲁国今从弟子科。\n只自倾心慙煦濡，何曾将口恨蹉跎。\n独赏谢吟山照耀，共知殷叹树婆娑。\n华毂苦嫌云路隔，衲衣长向雪峰何。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"颜真卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43525.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43525","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}